OL,3,GNEWSA'Fun fact - I'm the world's 10th
OL,4,Astrongest woman'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJade Skill only started going to the
OL,7,Fgym 18 months ago, but can now claim to
OL,8,Fbe the 10th strongest woman in the
OL,9,Fworld.
OL,11,FDuring her workouts, Skill, 34, from
OL,12,FBury St Edmunds, Suffolk, realised she
OL,13,Fwas more powerful than she first
OL,14,Fthought and started entering
OL,15,Fcompetitions.
OL,17,FAt the weekend, she stepped on to the
OL,18,Fglobal stage by taking part in the
OL,19,FWorld's Strongest Man and Woman 2026,
OL,20,Fheld near Glasgow and run by the
OL,21,FNatural Strongman Federation.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
